OL,3,GNEWSALoss of bus fare subsidies cause
OL,4,A'financial strain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FScrapping bus fare subsidies for
OL,7,Fover-16s in Rutland has led to
OL,8,Ffinancial strain on families, according
OL,9,Fto a council survey.
OL,11,FRutland County Council's cabinet
OL,12,Fapproved the School and Post-16 Travel
OL,13,FAssistance Policy update last year, in
OL,14,Fan effort to save costs.
OL,16,FIt led to a rise in the price of a bus
OL,17,Fpass for over-16s in mainstream
OL,18,Feducation from #624 per year to #1,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
