OL,3,GNEWSALoss of bus fare subsidies cause
OL,4,A'financial strain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to a report produced by
OL,7,FRutland County Council members, cutting
OL,8,Fthe subsidy led to 85 per cent of
OL,9,Ffamilies who responded to a council
OL,10,Fsurvey on the issue to suffer moderate
OL,11,Fto severe financial pressure.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
